<?xml version="1.0" standalone="yes"?>
<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
<!ENTITY name "npm-auto">
<!ENTITY author "dTrolley">
<!ENTITY github "&author;/&name;">
<!ENTITY launch "Settings/npm-auto">
<!ENTITY plugdir "/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/&name;">
<!ENTITY pluginURL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/&github;/main/&name;.plg">
<!ENTITY version "2026.07.17-9">
<!ENTITY md5 "1ed254d8329ca221c7e69b024ef518ac">
]>

<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" launch="&launch;" pluginURL="&pluginURL;" icon="folder-open-o" support="https://www.github.com/dTrolley/npm-auto" min="7.0.0">
    <CHANGES>
### 2026.07.17c
- Strict adoption: existing entries are adopted only when domain AND forward
  target both match; conflicts reject the toggle with a specific error
- Adopted hosts are fully managed thereafter (same policies as created ones)
- New "Auto-attach matching SSL certificate" setting
- Label override syntax (npm-auto.domain / npm-auto.port) documented on the
  settings page

### 2026.07.17b
- Auto-select an unexpired NPM certificate (exact or wildcard match) for new
  proxy hosts; force SSL when one is found
- Reconcile drift: created hosts follow default-domain/port/cert changes
- Adopt pre-existing hosts matching a container's domain without rewriting them
- New "toggle-off action" setting: Keep / Disable / Delete
- Cleanup controls on the settings page + prompt when disabling the plugin
- Uninstall never touches NPM entries

### 2026.07.17
- Fix settings persistence (PHP variable-scope bug) and CSRF token handling
- Unify settings as JSON shared by the settings page and daemon
- Remove debug logging that leaked session cookies to a public share
- Restore GitHub URL-based .plg install flow (was pointing at wrong branch)
- Implement NPM proxy-host reconciliation daemon (create/adopt/delete hosts)
- Add array started/stopping event hooks to manage the daemon
- Strip macOS metadata from packages

### 2025.11.07
- Initial Release by Gemini
    </CHANGES>

    <FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/&name;/&name;-&version;.txz" Run="upgradepkg --install-new">
        <URL>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/&github;/main/archive/&name;-&version;.txz</URL>
        <MD5>&md5;</MD5>
    </FILE>

    <FILE Run="/bin/bash">
        <INLINE>
            # Remove old package archives, keep the current one
            find /boot/config/plugins/&name;/ -name "&name;-*.txz" ! -name "&name;-&version;.txz" -delete
            mkdir -p /boot/config/plugins/&name;/var
            echo "&version;" > /boot/config/plugins/&name;/version
            # (Re)start the daemon so upgrades pick up new code
            &plugdir;/scripts/npm-auto-service.sh restart
            echo ""
            echo "----------------------------------------------------"
            echo " &name; has been installed."
            echo " Version: &version;"
            echo "----------------------------------------------------"
            echo ""
        </INLINE>
    </FILE>

    <FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
        <INLINE>
            &plugdir;/scripts/npm-auto-service.sh stop
            removepkg &name;-&version;
            rm -rf &plugdir;
            rm -rf /boot/config/plugins/&name;
        </INLINE>
    </FILE>
</PLUGIN>
